# Stack Test
# Praseodymium (Pr) — real density 6.773 g/cm³. three cubes stacked — simulate: collapse checks the load path.
scene "Praseodymium Stack Test"

bottom = cube 20mm color: #dfffaf at (0, 10mm, 0)
middle = cube 20mm color: #dfffaf at (0, 30mm, 0)
top = cube 20mm color: #dfffaf at (0, 50mm, 0)
